sequenceDiagram
    participant U as MCP Client (Claude Desktop / Cursor)
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant Cog as cognito_validator.py
    participant Q as query_rewriter.py
    participant BM as BM25 (in-memory index)
    participant PC as Pinecone
    participant R as reranker.py (CrossEncoder, container Lambda)
    participant G as answer_generator.py
    participant V as numerical_verifier.py
    participant L as logger.py

    U->>GW: call search_sec_filings (JSON-RPC over HTTP/SSE) + Bearer token
    GW->>Cog: forward request
    Cog->>Cog: fetch JWKS, validate signature/expiry/scope
    Cog-->>GW: 401 if invalid
    Cog->>Q: forward validated query
    Q->>Q: Haiku rewrite (expand tickers, extract dates)
    par parallel retrieval
        Q->>BM: keyword search -> top 10
        Q->>PC: dense search on rewritten query embedding -> top 10
    end
    Q->>Q: merge + dedupe by chunk_id -> up to 20 candidates
    Q->>R: (query, chunk_text) pairs
    R-->>Q: top 5 chunks by true relevance
    Q->>G: top 5 chunks + original query
    G->>G: Sonnet Converse API, cite every claim
    G->>V: draft answer with citations
    V->>V: extract numbers, verify against source chunks verbatim
    V-->>U: verified answer + citations + cost_usd + latency_ms
    V->>L: log stage-by-stage breakdown
    L->>L: write to DynamoDB + CloudWatch
